  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENPAX Environmental Peacebuilding Conference (Sierra Leone)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are supporting Green Scenery to attend an environmental peacebuilding conference, ENPAX, in Canada to share insights from Sierra Leone,&#x202f;where Christian Aid and&#x202f;local civil society, in partnership with the UN Peacebuilding&#x202f;Fund&#x202f;are supporting women and&#x202f;youth&#x202f;to&#x202f;secure&#x202f;their&#x202f;land rights.&#x202f;&#xa0;


The&#x202f;panellists&#x202f;will explore how&#x202f;access to&#x202f;land and&#x202f;inclusion&#x202f;in decision-making spaces&#x202f;enables&#x202f;marginalised&#x202f;women and youth&#x202f;to&#x202f;become powerful agents for peace.&#x202f;In Sierra Leone,&#x2018;Women&#x2019;s Land for Peace&#x2019;&#x202f;supports&#x202f;rural women to ensure implementation of&#x202f;new&#x202f;progressive natural governance laws.</narrative>
  </description>
